% سلام کلاس لاله in visual order. Code 03 is one glyph that maps to two
% characters, lam and alef, like the lam-alef ligature.
BT
/F1 12 Tf
20 150 Td
<0706030102030501040302> Tj
ET
% The same words with a mirrored matrix, so in logical order.
BT
-1 0 0 1 180 50 Tm
<0203040105030201030607> Tj
ET
endstream
